<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75982" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρέω</span></b>  (A), impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐούρουν </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
			D.
			54.4
		</span></i>; 
			Ion.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ᾽</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεσκον</span> (v. infr.): fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρήσω</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.85
			</span></i>; 
				Att.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1266
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐούρησα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				45
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έ</span>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐούρηκα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				402
			</span></i>: 
				Ion.
			
			plpf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρήκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.8.30
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				Ion.
			
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					1.92
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				571
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον</span> A):—
				<i>make water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				729
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				758
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.133
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			rei, <i>pass with the water</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.80
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				81
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεσκεν ὄφεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ant.Lib.
					41
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ οὐρούμενον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				584
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρέεται μᾶλλον</span>
			<i>is</i> more <i>diuretic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.46
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.32f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				4.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος -εόμενος</span>
			<i>diuretic</i> wine, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>act as diuretic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>.</div>
